   "text": "Orders come by DM, which works until you lock up at 6. A website keeps answering at night.\n\nWhat a florist website needs:\n1. This week's bouquets, with prices\n2. Subscriptions explained simply\n3. Same-day cutoff, stated plainly\n4. A 'pick me something' WhatsApp link\n\n📌 Save this for when you update your site.\n\nDescribe your business in plain language and get a free preview in about 30 seconds, no sign-up. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#floristlife #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
